</tbody></table></div><div class="two-grid"><section><h2>Portable contracts, measured claims.</h2><p>Forms belong to your GoFormX workspace. Assistants use scoped access through the ordinary API. Switching between independently verified assistants is still a future acceptance gate.</p><p>No provider endorsement or one-click integration is implied.</p></section><section><h2>Collection is independent of AI.</h2><p>A model call is not required to accept a submission. Human owners and admins use the dashboard to inspect authorized received data.</p><p>Email notification delivery and a second assistant harness remain unverified.</p></section></div><div class="callout"><p><strong>Developer preview.</strong> The service was deployed September 30. Broader first-use acceptance, source reconciliation and operational gates remain on the <a href="https://github.com/goformx/goformx/issues/125">release checklist</a>.</p></div><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/getting-started">Get started</a><a class="button secondary" href="/docs">Read the docs</a></div></div>
